 q h (NavierStokes.SlowExpansionResidual.angularExponent h) 1\n        f.flux f.axial f.phi w;\n  have U :=\n    NavierStokes.SlowExpansionResidual.transportTail N q h (NavierStokes.SlowExpansionResidual.axialExponent h) 0 f.flux\n      f.axial f.axial w;\n  NavierStokes.AxisymmetricResidual.pack (x.ofLp 0 * R - x.ofLp 1 * A) (x.ofLp 1 * R + x.ofLp 0 * A) U"}}
